{"id": 998028, "slug": "bachelairs", "name": "Bachelairs", "name_original": "Bachelairs", "description": "<h3>What is this game?</h3>Bachelairs is foremost a local multiplayer game where you race through a short set of dungeons. The goal is to collect the most coins, which can be done via collecting treasures, beating up monsters, investing in better gear or winning awards.<br/><br/><h3>Back story</h3>A kingdom far away is in need of brave warriors to help them get rid of a dungeon problem. Therefore they organized a grand tournament! Bachelors from across the kingdom will enter the dungeons, fight the monsters and loot the treasures there. The one that collects the most coin will win the cup and gets to marry one of the princes or princesses (consented)!<br/><br/><br/><br/> <h3>Features</h3><ul><li>each game takes about 10 - 15 minutes<br/></li><li>16 different playable characters<br/></li><li>5 different cups with 4 different dungeon types<br/></li><li>over 50 different items that you can use, such as weapons and hats</li></ul><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>Sokpop makes many short games. Get one every month!<br/><br/>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-02-19", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-02-21T09:25:28", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/efb/efb421c3f315946ecb62c6e9e1f24923.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/7bb/7bbcd42fb3d3b46516bdbab819c4214d.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 3, "added_by_status": {"owned": 3}, "playtime": 1, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 12, "parent_achievements_count": 12, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 132, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": ""